<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs up $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs up $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts sold unevenly $0.50 to $1.00 higher than late Monday. Demand was good. Top $51.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 49.50-51.00, few 49.00 &amp; 51.50.</p>
<p>Sows - not well established</p>
</text>
